@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+# Canonical Release Gate
+
+## Objective
+
+Prevent FinanceMeta from reporting a healthy release when only a placeholder test has passed.
+
+## Required command
+
+```bash
+npm ci
+npm run ci
+```
+
+`npm run ci` must complete all of the following:
+
+1. ESLint across the repository.
+2. TypeScript checking for the application and Node/Vite configuration.
+3. Production dependency audit with no high or critical findings.
+4. Vitest regression tests tied to real domain behavior.
+5. A production Vite build.
+
+## Current regression coverage
+
+The mapper suite verifies:
+
+- nullable database profile fields become optional domain fields;
+- missing essay aggregate counts default to zero;
+- event links are preserved only when represented as arrays;
+- nullable event timestamps and registration URLs remain optional.
+
+## Completion conditions
+
+A release is not ready until:
+
+- GitHub Actions passes on the exact commit;
+- the Vercel preview reaches Ready;
+- the deployed landing page and portal routes load;
+- Supabase authentication is exercised with a disposable account;
+- protected portal routes reject logged-out sessions;
+- core portal data reads and one representative write are verified;
+- no secrets are copied into logs, issues, or screenshots.
+
+## Rollback
+
+Promote the previous healthy Vercel deployment if the new production deployment fails, then investigate the exact release commit before redeploying.
